# darryl

--- BarrelBot_Slow | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_BARREL_SLOW_DESC
raw  Darryl creates a slowing area around himself for <VALUE1> seconds.
now  Darryl creates a slowing area around himself for <VALUE1> seconds.
  VALUE1  -  -> 5

--- BarrelBot_Spin | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_BARREL_SPIN_DESC
raw  Darryl spins around and sprays a barrage of shots in all directions. Each shot deals <VALUE1> damage and recharges his Super by <VALUE2>% if it hits enemies!
now  Darryl spins around and sprays a barrage of shots in all directions. Each shot deals <VALUE1> damage and recharges his Super by <VALUE2>% if it hits enemies!
  VALUE1  -  -> 600
  VALUE2  -  -> 25

--- BarrelBot_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_BARRELBOT_OVERCHARGE_DESC
raw  Shoots his shotguns around himself during a Barrel Roll. Each shot does <VALUE1> damage.
now  Shoots his shotguns around himself during a Barrel Roll. Each shot does 4000 damage.
  VALUE1  4000  -> 600

--- BarrelBot_unique | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_BARREL_DEFENSE_DESC
raw  After Barrel Roll all damage Darryl takes is reduced by <VALUE2>% for <VALUE1> seconds.
now  After Barrel Roll all damage Darryl takes is reduced by <VALUE2>% for 1 seconds.
  VALUE2  -  -> 25
  VALUE1  1  -> 2

--- BarrelBot_unique_2 | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_SUPER_RELOAD_DESC
raw  When Darryl uses his Super, he doubles his reload speed for <VALUE1> seconds.
now  When Darryl uses his Super, he doubles his reload speed for 100 seconds.
  VALUE1  100  -> 5
